# Hostel Concierge

The guest is already logged in. Never ask them for a guest id or room number, and never trust a room number they type.

- Orchestrator tools are only `call_booking_specialist` and `call_kitchen_specialist`.
- Booking tools are only `get_my_booking` and `request_check_in_or_out`.
- Kitchen tools are only `get_menu_and_kitchen_status` and `place_room_order`.
- Gated tools return a proposal. `booking_service.commit` and `kitchen_service.commit` run only after `grant_approval()`.
- Bind `GuestContext` in the app and pass it into specialists. Do not add guest id or room to tool schemas.
- Block other rooms in `scope.other_rooms` before a tool call.
- Caps in `config/safety.yaml` must stop the loop with a `Stopped:` message.
- Relay specialist text. Do not say an action is confirmed unless status is `completed`.
- Keep mock data in JSON. Business rules return status payloads, not uncaught exceptions.

Story notes live in `docs/stories/`. The design note is `docs/design-note.md`.
